%F A386831 a(n) = Sum_{k=0..n} 5^k * (-2)^(n-k) * binomial(4*n+1,k).
%F A386831 a(n) = Sum_{k=0..n} 5^k * 3^(n-k) * binomial(3*n+k,k).
%F A386831 Conjecture D-finite with recurrence 18744*n*(3*n-1)*(3*n-2)*a(n) +(203878391*n^3 -1040550807*n^2+1658851582*n -822702720) *a(n-1) +27*(-252935041*n^3 +1277608165*n^2 -1931547954*n +777640080)*a(n-2) +3645*(-38797609*n^3 +259381745*n^2 -614869982*n +523823440)*a(n-3) -16309333800*(2*n-7) *(4*n-13) *(4*n-11)*a(n-4)=0. - _R. J. Mathar_, Nov 02 2026
